  "title": "A universal group with thirteen relators",
  "abstract": "Lean 4 proof that there exists a presentation with two generators and thirteen relators whose group contains an isomorphic copy of every finitely presented group. The construction combines a universal finitely presented input, positive preparation, word recognition, a six-generator nineteen-relator host, and a final HNN compression.",
